{"Function named 'TwoFactor' but component handles backup codes - should be renamed to 'BackupCode' to match actual functionality": 0.5868468284606934, "Inconsistent error handling: code uses 'throw new Error' while the rest of the file uses 'return res.status(...).json(...)' which could lead to unexpected error propagation": 0.3648104965686798, "Potential issue with null values in backup codes array: after a backup code is used it's set to null but the array still contains null values, polluting the array over time instead of using filter or splice to remove used codes": 0.17231625318527222, "Complex nested ternary operator reduces readability and should be refactored to use if-else statement or helper function": 0.013896051794290543, "No validation for backup codes exhaustion: when all 10 backup codes are used (all set to null), there's no specific error message to help users understand they need to regenerate codes": 0.37548571825027466, "resetState function doesn't reset all state variables (backupCodes, backupCodesUrl, dataUri, secret, isSubmitting) and doesn't revoke backupCodesUrl to prevent memory leaks": 0.7359018325805664, "Missing input validation for backup code format (expected 'XXXXX-XXXXX' with optional dash) - should add client-side format validation for better UX": 0.047190673649311066, "Test coverage is incomplete: backup code login and disabling 2FA with backup code are not yet tested as indicated by TODO comment": 0.22281183302402496, "formatBackupCode arrow function is used before it is defined which is confusing and could be error-prone - should be moved before handleSetup function": 0.22411133348941803, "Memory leak potential: blob URL created for backup codes download is never revoked when component unmounts - need useEffect cleanup function": 0.6055527925491333}